The Division serves the supplemental production indexed in the attachment. =
It comprises the eleven emails from the 2011 examination sequence and their=
 attachments, and one message dated October 21, 2013, all recovered from th=
e Commission's electronic mail journal archive, produced in native form wit=
h headers.<br />
<br />
Your motion asked the Division to produce a document showing that something=
 was required of your client in 2011. Document 3 of the production is the s=
taff's deficiency letter of April 20, 2011. Document 10 is your client's ch=
ief compliance officer's letter of June 2, 2011 accepting Item 4, describin=
g the corrective action taken, and giving an undertaking expressly stated t=
o be without an expiration date. Document 13 is your client's own letter of=
 October 21, 2013 applying that undertaking to an acquired book of business=
 without being asked.<br />
<br />
The Division's opposition will be filed on schedule. Given the content of t=
he production, counsel may wish to confer before then.<br />
